<div id="S8.SS2.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S8.SS2.p5.1" class="ltx_p">After the qualitative <span id="S8.SS2.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;assessment&gt;</span> is produced by the LLM, we incorporate ground-truth semantic and geometric information to complete the structured answer. Each supportive and harmful feature is listed, followed by per-class distances computed from metric depth. The fixed template used for augmentation is shown below.</p>
</div>
<div id="S8.SS2.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="S8.SS2.p6.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="27.13" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 687.5 27.13" width="687.5"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,27.13) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#DFDFDF;" fill="#DFDFDF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 27.13 L 687.5 27.13 L 687.5 0 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2F2;" fill="#F2F2F2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 27.13 L 687.5 27.13 L 687.5 0 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 7.87 10.33)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:48.55em;--ltx-fo-height:0.64em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.18em;font-size:10pt;" height="11.38" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.92)" width="671.8"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="S8.SS2.p6.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:48.55em;">
